<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Elden Ring</Major>
    <Description>elden ring sacred relic sword farm (this is a slight change to one of the already made macros, issues with the teleport confirmation not placed correctly. This change just uses E to confirm the tp instead of mouse click.)
teleport to the Palace approach ledge road site of grace, do not move the mouse at all and start the program
1600 dpi
1920x1080
MAP MUST BE ZOOMED IN ALL THE WAY FOR THE MAP TP TO WORK OR YOU WILL TP WRONG AND LOSE YOUR RUNES
MUST HAVE SACRED RELIC SWORD TWO HANDED
it should put you just a little after the high rock point and be angles well enough to hit almost every enemy every time with only 1 attack
*DISCLAIMER*: THE ISSUE IS NOT PRESENT FOR EVERYONE, HOWEVER IF YOUR USING THE ORIGINAL ONE AND THE MOUSE IS NOT MOVING TO THE CONFIRMATION ON THE TP CORRECTLY USE THIS.</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
